   "text": "The bowel is opened along the  antimesenteric surface \nto reveal multiple diverticula and a firm white region in the \nbowel wall with central pus and necrosis.  ___ diagnosis by",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=3864-4041",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s35",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Dr. ___ is:  \"Extensive diverticular disease with focal \nsurface adhesion and mesenteric abscess that likely represents \nprior ruptured diverticulum.\"  The mucosa is otherwise tan and \nunremarkable.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4043-4241",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s36",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No masses or polyps are identified.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4243-4278",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s38",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Within the mesentery, \nfive potential lymph nodes are identified.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4333-4398",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s39",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Representative \nsections are submitted as follows: A=distal margin, B=proximal \nmargin, C-G=bowel with diverticula and abscess, H=uninvolved \nbowel, I-J=lymph nodes.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4400-4565",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was admitted to the General Surgical Service for \nevaluation and treatment.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4592-4679",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On ___, the patient underwent an \nopen sigmoid colectomy, which went well without complication",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4681-4775",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "(reader referred to the Operative Note for details).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4777-4829",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "After a \nbrief, uneventful stay in the PACU, the patient arrived on the \nfloor NPO, on IV fluids and antibiotics, with a foley catheter,",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4830-4966",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "JP drain, and dilaudid PCA for pain control.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=4968-5012",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was \nhemodynamically stable.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5014-5054",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Neuro: The patient received dilaudid with good effect and \nadequate pain control.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5056-5137",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "When tolerating oral intake, the patient \nwas transitioned to oral pain medications.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5139-5223",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CV: The patient remained stable from a cardiovascular \nstandpoint; vital signs were routinely monitored.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5225-5329",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was placed \non his home doses of lisinopril and HCTZ with good control of \nhis HTN.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5331-5417",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Pulmonary: The patient remained stable from a pulmonary \nstandpoint; vital signs were routinely monitored.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5421-5527",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Good pulmonary \ntoilet, early ambulation and incentive spirrometry were \nencouraged throughout hospitalization.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5528-5639",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "GI/GU/FEN: Post-operatively, the patient was made NPO with IV \nfluids.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5641-5711",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Diet was advanced when appropriate, which was well \ntolerated.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5712-5774",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient's intake and output were closely monitored, \nand IV fluid was adjusted when necessary.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5776-5870",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Electrolytes were \nroutinely followed, and repleted when necessary.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5872-5939",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD 3, the",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5941-5954",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "JP drain was removed without complication after drain output had \ntapered to <20cc output/shift.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=5956-6052",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "ID: The patient's white blood count and fever curves were \nclosely watched for signs of infection.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6054-6152",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's wounds \nwere examined every day.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6155-6201",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Overlying dressings were removed on",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6203-6238",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD1, no erythema, induration or discharge was seen.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6240-6292",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "In the \npreoperative period, the patient received cefazolin and \nmetronidazole.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6294-6373",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Endocrine: The patient's blood sugar was monitored throughout \nhis stay; insulin dosing was adjusted accordingly.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6377-6490",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Hematology: The patient's complete blood count was examined \nroutinely; no transfusions were required.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6492-6594",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s26",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Prophylaxis: The patient received subcutaneous heparin and \nvenodyne boots were used during this stay; was encouraged to get \nup and ambulate as early as possible.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6596-6759",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s27",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of discharge, the patient was doing well, afebrile \nwith stable vital signs.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6761-6849",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s28",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was tolerating a regular \ndiet, ambulating, voiding without assistance, and pain was well \ncontrolled.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=6851-6965",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:MEDADM:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "MEDADM",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The Preadmission Medication list is accurate and complete.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=7133-7191",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:MEDADM:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "MEDADM",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1. Lisinopril 5 mg PO DAILY",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=7192-7219",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:MEDADM:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "MEDADM",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2. Hydrochlorothiazide 25 mg PO DAILY",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=7221-7258",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Mental Status: Clear and coherent.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=7871-7905",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Level of Consciousness: Alert and interactive.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=7906-7952",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Activity Status: Ambulatory - Independent.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=13525859-DS-11:chars=7953-7995",
   "needs": []
  },
